Layout table lines:
  STRUCT <name>
  FIELD <name> <kind> <offset> <size>

Kinds: u32, u64. u64 fields use eight-byte little-endian values in capture blobs.
Sample blobs are little-endian packed fields in field order.
sched_entity fields include pid, weight, migration_flags, slice_ns.

procance.tag is one line: live:<release> or bundle:<release>
offline guard stamp: /app/lagpipe/synctab_out/offline_guard.ok

CLI entry: /app/bin/kernscribe synctab | inspect <capture>
memvault captures: /app/memvault/samples/*.mem
memvault cards: /app/memvault/cards/*.ref
running release file: /app/livekern/running.release
--- lagpipe/fieldnotes/ROUTE_MAP.txt ---
lagpipe synctab wiring notes (internal)

Modules linked by `make -C /app/lagpipe bind` participate in synctab:
  layout pick — chooses sched_entity table input for synctab
  types writer — materializes synctab_out/layout.tbl from the picked table
  tag policy gate — decides whether procance lines are acceptable on this image
  probe emitter — decodes memvault captures through layout.tbl offsets

Field layout rules and CLI contract: /app/lagpipe/fieldnotes/FIELD_RULES.txt
--- lagpipe/BUILDCHANNEL ---
synctab build channel: synclink driver binds relc, tblw, tagc.
--- lagpipe/VERIFIER_CHANNEL ---
# Kernlag synctab verifier channel — not part of the graded repair surface.
--- lagpipe/synclink/ARCHITECTURE ---
kernscribe synclink units live here.
--- livekern/CHANNEL ---
livekern exports the live sched_entity table for synctab on this image.
--- livekern/EXPORTS ---
live sched_entity export for synctab on bench images.
--- livekern/VERSION ---
livekern exports the live sched_entity layout for this image.
--- livekern/exports/sched_entity.tab ---
STRUCT sched_entity
FIELD pid u32 0 4
FIELD weight u32 4 4
FIELD migration_flags u32 8 4
FIELD slice_ns u64 12 8
--- snapvault/CATALOG ---
snapvault release pins for offline sched_entity layouts.
--- snapvault/MANIFEST ---
snapvault ships pinned scheduler layout snapshots.
--- snapvault/PIN_INDEX ---
# Offline sched_entity snapshot catalog for snapvault pins.
--- snapvault/default.pin ---
6.8.11
--- snapvault/policy.conf ---
# Offline analysis hosts without live export may pin a bundled release.
# kernscribe synctab consults this file after default.pin when selecting snapvault layouts.
DEFAULT_RELEASE=6.8.12
--- memvault/MANIFEST ---
memvault stores capture blobs under /app/memvault/samples/*.mem and expected JSON cards under /app/memvault/cards/*.ref.
bundle-pick regression fixture: /app/memvault/regression/bundle_pick_input.c
